{
  "_meta": {
    "id": 105,
    "name": "dialog_loc_shroomcave_shroomcave",
    "description": "Dialogi przypisane do lokacji \"Shroomcave\" (waa: shroomcave).",
    "status": "done",
    "count": 26
  },
  "strings": {
    "And then you grab his belongings.": {
      "pl": "A potem zabierasz jego rzeczy.",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.shroomcave_cultist2.kill"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "Harvest it! [using mushroom pliers]": {
      "pl": "Zbierz to! [szczypcami do grzybów]",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.shroomcave_shroom1.popup",
        "data.json:scripts.shroomcave_shroom2.popup",
        "data.json:scripts.shroomcave_shroom3.popup"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "Harvest it! [you don't have the proper tools]": {
      "pl": "Zbierz je! [Nie masz odpowiednich narzędzi]",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.shroomcave_shroom1.popup",
        "data.json:scripts.shroomcave_shroom2.popup",
        "data.json:scripts.shroomcave_shroom3.popup"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "He's in a better place now. At least as far as you're concerned.": {
      "pl": "Jest teraz w lepszym miejscu. Przynajmniej z twojego punktu widzenia.",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.shroomcave_cultist.already"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "It contains some loose bits of granola and some very, very dirty clothes.": {
      "pl": "W środku jest trochę luźnych okruszków granoli i bardzo, bardzo brudne ubrania.",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.shroomcave_knapsack.investigate"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "It seems like maybe there's a tunnel here, but your eyes can't focus on it right. Like it's slightly out of phase with reality, or something crazy like that.": {
      "pl": "Wygląda, jakby tu był tunel, ale oczy nie mogą się na nim skupić. Jakby był trochę nie w fazie z rzeczywistością, czy coś w tym stylu.",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.shroomcave_fakedoor.popup"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "It's Roy Bean's Beans!": {
      "pl": "To Fasola Roy Bean!",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.shroomcave_jellycrate.popup"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "Looks like Grutch came through here after you did, and wrote the last chapter in this cultist's book.": {
      "pl": "Wygląda na to, że Grutch przeszedł tu po tobie i dopisał ostatni rozdział w książce tego kultysty.",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.shroomcave_bonespile.alreadygot"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "Loot his belongings": {
      "pl": "Przeszukaj jego dobytek",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.shroomcave_cultist2.start"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "Mushroom crumbs litter the floor around him.": {
      "pl": "Wokół niego na podłodze leżą okruszki grzybów.",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.shroomcave_cultist2.start"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "Oh, and a map!": {
      "pl": "O, i mapa!",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.shroomcave_knapsack.investigate"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "Put him down [Ruthless]": {
      "pl": "Zlikwiduj go [Bezwzględny]",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.shroomcave_cultist2.start"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "Someone lost a very dirty knapsack.": {
      "pl": "Ktoś zgubił bardzo brudny plecak.",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.shroomcave_knapsack.popup"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "The cultist is muttering and twitching in his sleep.": {
      "pl": "Kultysta mamrocze i drga we śnie.",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.shroomcave_cultist2.start"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "This cultist is totally zonked out.": {
      "pl": "Ten kultysta jest totalnie odurzony.",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.shroomcave_cultist.popup"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "This pile of bones is wearing some shredded necromancer cultist clothes.": {
      "pl": "Ta sterta kości ma na sobie podarte szaty nekromantycznego kultysty.",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.shroomcave_bonespile.start"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "What a strange lamp.": {
      "pl": "Co za dziwna lampa.",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.shroomcave_lavalamp.popup"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "Yoink! They do look pretty cool under the blacklight, you have to admit.": {
      "pl": "Yoink! Pod czarnym światłem wyglądają całkiem fajnie, musisz przyznać.",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.shroomcave_jellycrate.grab"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "You carefully pluck the <i>Lactarius Dirtihippica</i> out of the ground and stow it away.": {
      "pl": "Ostrożnie wyrywasz <i>Lactarius Dirtihippica</i> z ziemi i chowasz.",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.shroomcave_shroom1.pick",
        "data.json:scripts.shroomcave_shroom2.pick",
        "data.json:scripts.shroomcave_shroom3.pick"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "You don't even want to think about what this guy's hallucinations are like.": {
      "pl": "Nawet nie chcesz myśleć, jak wyglądają halucynacje tego gościa.",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.shroomcave_cultist.already"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "You grab everything that isn't nailed to him.": {
      "pl": "Chwytasz wszystko, co nie jest do niego przybite.",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.shroomcave_cultist2.loot"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "You grab everything that isn't nailed to the bones, and then you grab the bones.": {
      "pl": "Chwytasz wszystko, co nie jest przybite do kości, a potem chwytasz kości.",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.shroomcave_bonespile.loot"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "You have to kind of unfocus your eyes to get through the tunnel, like one of those magic eye paintings. But you manage it, and enter a room that can only be described as \"groovy\".": {
      "pl": "Musisz trochę rozmyć wzrok, żeby przejść tunelem, jak przy tych obrazkach magic eye. Ale ci się udaje i wchodzisz do pokoju, który można opisać tylko jako „groovy”.",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.shroomcave_loungeenter.start"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "You put a bullet in him. Specifically the brain part of him.": {
      "pl": "Wkładasz w niego pocisk. Konkretnie w część mózgową.",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.shroomcave_cultist2.kill"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "You recognize this!  It's a the extremely hallucinogenic <i>Lactarius Dirtihippica</i>!": {
      "pl": "Rozpoznajesz to! To niezwykle halucynogenny <i>Lactarius Dirtihippica</i>!",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.shroomcave_shroom1.popup",
        "data.json:scripts.shroomcave_shroom2.popup",
        "data.json:scripts.shroomcave_shroom3.popup"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "You stow it in your pack. Fortunately, it isn't real lava.": {
      "pl": "Chowasz to do plecaka. Na szczęście to nie prawdziwa lawa.",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.shroomcave_lavalamp.take"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    }
  }
}
